                                        "entry_id": "ad8528ce-361c-3b2e-83dd-f0aab45dbe61",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A spicy, smoked sausage of a particular kind from Eastern Europe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
